    <h1>How to Run QA Inside Agile Sprint Cycles Without Slowing Down</h1>
    <p class="post-hero-lead">QA in agile works when it is embedded in the sprint from day one. QA at the end of the sprint is damage control with a name badge. Here is what the difference looks like in practice.</p>
